{"version":1,"content":"<p>寶馬（香港）昨晚在香港推出全新改良版 BMW 7 系豪華旗艦房車，代理在尖沙咀海運大廈天台 Ocean Terminal Deck 舉行大型VIP預覽會。</p><p>新款 BMW 7 首度將品牌 Neue Klasse 新世代設計及數碼技術融入旗艦豪華房車系列，香港版總共6款型號涵蓋汽油 Mild-Hybrid 輕混能、PHEV 插電混能及 BEV 純電的三大動力陣容，香港售價由 HK$1,629,000 起</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T01:38:29.555400+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":0,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"rss-empty","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:21:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T03:44:09.665905+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T01:31:52.606261+00:00","content_hash":"a5d37ac7acd12a50ff8be282907a46943ab4ae7ab30e7118e3af2d6a1ebe525c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}